    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Black Baby is lost in an underground maze. Explore the maze, fight gigantic creatures, and find your way to freedom by collecting keys and opening doors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bring light to the darkest corners</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1521110/extras/f800e301ab41648342165ac84ffe76a4.avif?t=1744450444\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape from enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1521110/extras/aaa5f6da10db95df214df143481089d0.avif?t=1744450444\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight them back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1521110/extras/18eef9aeecaa2ce48f95a715fd34d8cd.avif?t=1744450444\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Consume their souls to restore your health</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1521110/extras/ba3acbb30950b2c3ba598937a54c0279.avif?t=1744450444\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keyboard/Mouse controls</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move: WASD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Camera: Mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Run: Left shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Attack: Left mouse button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Aim: Right mouse\u00a0button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Throw: Left mouse button (while aiming) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Throw up: Middle mouse button </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Drop Item: E</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Xbox controller controls</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move: Left stick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Camera: Right stick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Run: Left trigger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Attack: Right bumper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Aim: Left bumper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Throw: Right bumper (while aiming) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Throw up: Y button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Drop Item: B button</p></li></ul>",
